  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Alpha Gelida** (1 other source): Played in John's solo section among rarer songs; the only performance of this song in 2022 [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Bones Don't Rust**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Transjordanian Blues**: rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n- **Alpha Gelida**: back after 52 archived shows (1001 days); rare: 12 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2022-11-18.ecm** (recommended): source not stated; 18 songs; 77 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Final show of the 2022 European tour; a strict curfew, which John apologised for, shortened the set [1]\n- Excited Irish crowd gave a frenetic energy; their cheering and clapping sometimes overloads the microphone [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2022-11-18.ecm**: source: SONY ECM CS-10 > Roland R-05 [1]",
